# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEPRECATED. Do not edit. Do not use this file as a configuration source.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Canonical staging template lives in:   .env.staging.example
#
# Real staging credentials never live in this repository. They are managed by
# ops via the Railway dashboard (or equivalent secret store) and injected at
# runtime. This file is retained only to preserve git history; it will be
# untracked in a future cleanup once tooling no longer references it.
#
# See: docs/hosting/ for the staging deploy runbook and the canonical list of
# environment variables. See: docs/runbooks/credential-key-rotation.md for
# rotation procedures.
#
# This file is also listed in .gitignore so subsequent local edits to it will
# not be tracked. If you intended to configure a local staging profile, copy
# .env.staging.example to .env.staging.local instead.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
